<h1>Aqueous Archive Format</h1>
<pre class=metadata>
Shortname: aqueous
Status: LS
Boilerplate: omit feedback-header
Editor: Kang Seonghoon, https://mearie.org/
Repository: TODO
Abstract: This specification defines the Aqueous archive format, a compressed archive format designed for efficient storage and retrieval of files.
