              </li>
            </ol>
          </li>

          <li>Let |overhead| be the sum of:
            <ul>
              <li>The size of the LEB128-encoded |originalSize| - |compressedSize| ([=cblock/original_size_delta=]),</li>
              <li>The size of the LEB128-encoded |compressedSize| ([=cblock/compressed_size=]),</li>
              <li>The length of |compressionParams|,</li>
              <li>8 if checksum is enabled (|checksum_size| for XXH64),</li>
              <li>And 3 bytes for the Zstandard block header.</li>
            </ul>
          </li>

          <li>If |compressedSize| + |overhead| is greater than or equal to |originalSize|:
            <ol>
              <li>Set |useCompression| to false.</li>
            </ol>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </li>

      <li>If |useCompression| is true:
        <ol>
          <li>Let |originalSizeDelta| be |originalSize| - |compressedSize|.</li>

          <li>Let |checksum| be an empty byte sequence.
          <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["checksum"] is true:
            <ol>
              <li>Let |checksum| be the XXH64 hash of |compressedData| with seed 0, encoded as a u64le.</li>
            </ol>
          </li>

          <li>Let |chunk| be a [=cblock/chunk=] with:
            <ul>
              <li>[=cblock/compressed_size=] = |compressedSize|,</li>
              <li>[=cblock/original_size_delta=] = |originalSizeDelta|,</li>
              <li>[=cblock/compression_params=] = |compressionParams|,</li>
              <li>[=cblock/data=] = |compressedData|,</li>
              <li>[=cblock/checksum=] = |checksum|.</li>
            </ul>
          </li>

          <li>Append |chunk| to |compressedChunks|.</li>
        </ol>
      </li>
      <li>Otherwise:
        <ol>
          <li>Let |checksum| be an empty byte sequence.
          <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["checksum"] is true:
            <ol>
              <li>Let |checksum| be the XXH64 hash of |chunkData| with seed 0, encoded as a u64le.</li>
            </ol>
          </li>

          <li>Let |uncompressedBlock| be an [=uncompressed block=] containing |chunkData| and |checksum|.</li>
          <li>Write |uncompressedBlock| to |outputFile|.</li>
        </ol>
      </li>

      <li>Set |chunkOffset| to |chunkOffset| + |currentChunkSize|.
      <li>Increment |chunkIndex| by 1.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>

  <li>If |compressedChunks| is not empty:
    <ol>
      <li>Let |blockType| be 20<sub>16</sub> (compressed block, no dictionary, no transformer, no checksum).</li>
      <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["checksum"] is true, set |blockType| to 24<sub>16</sub>.</li>
      <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["transformer"] is provided, add 8<sub>16</sub> to |blockType|.</li>
      <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["dictionary"] is provided, add 16<sub>16</sub> to |blockType|.</li>

      <li>Let |compressedBlock| be a [=compressed block=] of type |blockType| containing all chunks in |compressedChunks|.
      <li>Write |compressedBlock| to |outputFile|.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>

  <li>Let |archiveEnd| be the current position in |outputFile|.</li>

  <li>Let |metadataBlock| be a [=metadata block=] describing the compressed and uncompressed content.</li>
  <li>Write |metadataBlock| to |outputFile|.</li>

  <li>Let |footerStart| be the current position in |outputFile|.</li>

  <li>Let |sizeHint| be |archiveEnd| - (position after [=archive/header_magic=]).</li>

  <li>Write the [=archive/footer_magic=] to |outputFile|.</li>
  <li>Write the [=archive/footer_size=] (placeholder, to be filled later) to |outputFile|.</li>
  <li>Write the [=archive/size_hint=] to |outputFile|.</li>
  <li>Write the [=archive/metadata_backward_offset=] to |outputFile|.</li>
  <li>Let |footerEnd| be the current position in |outputFile|.</li>
  <li>Let |footerSize| be |footerEnd| - |footerStart|.</li>

  <li>Seek back to the position of [=archive/footer_size=] in |outputFile| and write |footerSize|.</li>
  <li>Write the [=archive/footer_size_copy=] (= |footerSize|) to |outputFile|.</li>

