    <ol>
      <li>Seek back to the [=szhint/size_hint=] field in the size hint block and write |sizeHint|.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>

  <li>Close |inputFile| and |outputFile|.</li>
  <li>Return success.</li>
</ol>

<p>To <dfn export>compress a byte sequence</dfn> given |data| and |compressionMethod|:</p>

<ol class=algorithm>
  <li>If |compressionMethod| is Zstandard:
    <ol>
      <li>Let |compressed| be the result of compressing |data| using the Zstandard compression algorithm [[RFC8878]].
        If the compression fails, return failure.</li>
      <li>Return |compressed|.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>

  <li>Return failure.</li>
</ol>
